    "title": "EU Approves Loan for Ukraine Worth Over $100 Billion | NTD",
    "text": "The European Union today approved a loan for Ukraine worth over $100 billion dollars. The president of the European Parliament Roberta Metsola says, \"This will ensure that essential public services can continue, while Ukraine’s defense remains strong.\"\nUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy is thanking the EU, saying: \"It is important that this is precisely the signal that must be sent to the aggressor. Ukraine will endure and can protect lives.\"",
